  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Inclusive Access to Justice in Yemen: Phase Two (PIAJY II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to contribute to SDG 16 (16.3. promote the rule of law and ensure access to justice for all) and SDG 5 (5.2. eliminate all forms of violence against all women and girls; 5.5. ensure women&#x2019;s full and effective participation and equal opportunities for leadership at all levels). The project has three Outputs: 1. Civil and property justice promoted, 2. Gender and inclusive justice enhanced, 3. Comprehensive detainee protection expanded.</narrative>
  </description>
